-def picture_facts(fmt, info, answer, dark=None, light=None):
+def picture_facts(fmt, info, answer, dark=None, light=None, clip=None):
     '''One line for the summary file: what went out and what the user answered (English, for a
-    diagnostic report).'''
+    diagnostic report). clip: how the clip played (CheckSetup.play(): why it stopped, and when it came
+    up over the whole screen), or None.'''
